    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 - Registro de Productos via WhatsApp\n\nPermite al admin crear productos enviando una imagen + texto por WhatsApp.\n\n**Flujo:**\n1. Recibe mensaje de WhatsApp (Evolution API)\n2. Verifica si es el numero del admin (ADMIN_PHONE)\n3. Si tiene imagen: descarga imagen, extrae datos con IA, sube a Cloudinary, crea producto en API\n4. Si no tiene imagen: pide que envie foto del producto\n5. Espera 3-5 min (delay natural) y envia confirmacion\n\n**Variables de entorno necesarias:**\n- ADMIN_PHONE\n- EVOLUTION_API_URL, EVOLUTION_API_KEY, EVOLUTION_INSTANCE\n- CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME, CLOUDINARY_API_KEY, CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET\n- CATALOG_API_URL, CATALOG_ADMIN_EMAIL, CATALOG_ADMIN_PASSWORD",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 350
      },
      "id": "sticky-info",
      "name": "Info del Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-phone",
              "name": "senderPhone",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.key.remoteJid.replace('@s.whatsapp.net', '') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-message",
              "name": "messageText",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.message.conversation || $json.body.data.message.imageMessage?.caption || $json.body.data.message.extendedTextMessage?.text || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-has-image",
              "name": "hasImage",
              "value": "={{ !!$json.body.data.message.imageMessage }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-image-mimetype",
              "name": "imageMimetype",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.data.message.imageMessage?.mimetype || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-message-key",
              "name": "messageKey",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body.data.key) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-instance",
              "name": "instanceName",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.instance }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "extract-data",
